[length:02:42]
[ti:Tanks in cloths]
[ar:Aracnephobia]
[al:Chaotic Dysfuntional]
[au:Aracne]
[lr:Aracne]
[by:Aracne]
[re:LRC Workbench by Azaria (lrc-workbench.azariadev.dev)]
[ve:0.3.3]
[00:02.31]Another price hike...
[00:05.48]Another monthly fee...
[00:09.06]Blizzard rolled a crit.
[00:11.98]My wallet wiped again.
[00:27.28]I miss my undead Shadow Priest,
[00:29.90]wandering through Azeroth.
[00:33.48]Healing nothing, melting minds,
[00:36.67]forgetting what the real world costs.
[00:40.05]I used to farm for mounts all night,
[00:43.33]now I farm to pay my bills.
[00:46.87]Gold goes up, my balance drops...
[00:49.82]I can't afford subscription kills.
[00:53.47]More than fifteen years I've stayed,
[00:56.68]through every patch and every war.
[00:59.93]I kept believing in the dream,
[01:03.67]even when it hurt much more.
[01:06.63]I've watched the people build this world
[01:10.07]pay a price they never should.
[01:13.42]Still I wanted to believe...
[01:16.57]that someday things would turn out good.
[01:19.97]Now every month gets harder still,
[01:23.47]both in game and in real life.
[01:26.59]Living in Azeroth one more month...
[01:29.40]feels like another boss to fight.
[01:33.50]I wanna log in.
[01:35.40]I wanna raid.
[01:37.24]But my bank keeps saying:
[01:39.34]"Access denied."
[01:41.60]I wanna go back to Azeroth,
[01:44.04]where at least I know my role.
[01:48.14]Out here I'm a tank in cloth,
[01:50.67]everyone keeps hitting...
[01:52.57]while I soak every blow.
[01:55.36]I wanna go back to Azeroth.
[01:57.31]Even fishing sounds alright.
[02:00.98]Every day WoW costs a little more...
[02:04.04]and every day
[02:06.46]I'm a little more broke.
[02:10.78]Need!
[02:12.91]Greed!
[02:13.63]No loot for me!
[02:21.08]See you at the inn...
[02:23.98]when payday finally comes.
[02:27.26]Unless the next patch...
[02:30.26]raises the price...
[02:33.66]again.
